<title>USA: Jay Jacobs says May same-stores sales up.</title>
<headline>Jay Jacobs says May same-stores sales up.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jay Jacobs Inc said comparable store sales increased six percent for the month.</p>
<p>For the first four months sales were $18,274,000.</p>
<p>Comparable store sales increased 7% for the four month period. The company said sales for May were $4,809,000.</p>
